      "text": "gold_fire_dedup\n| where ingest_ts > ago(6h)\n| where sensor_class in ('geostationary', 'polar')\n| extend lag_min = (ingest_ts - acq_datetime) / 1m\n| where lag_min between (0.0 .. 600.0)\n| summarize ['Median lag min'] = round(percentile(lag_min, 50), 1),\n            ['P90 lag min'] = round(percentile(lag_min, 90), 1),\n            ['Detections'] = count()\n  by ['Sensor tier'] = sensor_class",
